      "url": "https://github.com/wine-mirror/wine/blob/415a275e3844c252ad385b46023095e9401ca234/dlls/d3d9/tests/device.c",
      "evidence": "Windows missing-declaration test3171\u20133203: PrimitiveUP returns INVALIDCALL,stream0 becomesNULL while stride remains prior sizeof(vertex);IndexedUP returns INVALIDCALL and index buffer becomesNULL. Missing cleanup remains todo_wine. Success3220+/3259+ zeroes stream metadata;3270+ proves successful UP cleanup not recorded in stateblocks."
    },
    {
      "file": "d3d9-map-device.c",
      "blobSha1": "2d036f2c22ef92b0c3b55fccf1bb2af477c9b146",
      "sha256": "b70a5ed02fdd3e72f030d492770b13a16e8cd73b51c2ac8684e08f921af6fd58",
      "url": "https://github.com/wine-mirror/wine/blob/415a275e3844c252ad385b46023095e9401ca234/dlls/d3d9/device.c",
      "evidence": "Pinned Wine DrawPrimitiveUP3327\u20133337 and DrawIndexedPrimitiveUP3391\u20133401 explicitly check zero stride before zero primitive count; the latter succeeds before vertex-declaration/data upload checks. This implementation is the new zero-count ordering oracle; Windows missing-declaration tests remain independent retained evidence."
    }
  ],
  "scope": "Stage4J12 follows pinned Wine public UP3327+/3390+ ordering: nonzero stride plus zero primitive count returns success before vertex data/format validation. Zero stride remains INVALIDCALL; no binding/metadata/FVF/clip status/resource/refcount/recording or transport effects. Native15808 new checks,64 pool/format/record/owner profiles,4096 noops and4096 zero-stride refusals,10 strict runtime mutants,old actual public UP controls and ASAN/UBSAN. XP adds512 noops and512 zero-stride refusals across missing/valid declaration and recording checkpoints to previous real draw/refusal story;528 stream and262 indices queries prove preserved state,including null/poison pointers and ignored overflow/invalid primitive input. Physical wire retains five buffers,one canonical declaration,seven streams/two indices and four draw packets plus Reset/Clear;no additional draw/upload packets for empty calls. Dual GPU independently validates320 pixels. This zero-count oracle is current pinned Wine implementation,not an additional native Microsoft HAL experiment. Prior Windows missing-format/success paths remain verified; full retail input coverage,D3D8 wrapper,thread/loss/full Reset/format/MSAA/fullscreen/multibuffer,native HAL,games/FPS and stages4/5/6 remain open. Host/protocol/shader/bundle and D3D8/DDraw unchanged.",
